WEBVTT

00:04:29.163 --> 00:04:30.314
BS: Yeah.

00:04:30.338 --> 00:04:34.237
JL: I wanted to do what I could
to make things better,

00:04:34.261 --> 00:04:37.616
'cause when you see something
that is not right or fair or just,

00:04:37.640 --> 00:04:39.188
you have to say something.

00:04:39.212 --> 00:04:40.457
You have to do something.

00:04:40.481 --> 00:04:44.827
It's like a fire burning up in your bones,

00:04:44.851 --> 00:04:47.461
and you cannot be silenced.

00:04:47.485 --> 00:04:48.731
BS: That's right.

00:04:48.755 --> 00:04:53.651
JL: My mother would have said to me,
"Boy, don't get in trouble.

00:04:53.675 --> 00:04:55.447
Don't get in trouble.

00:04:55.471 --> 00:04:59.179
You can get hurt, you can get killed."

00:04:59.203 --> 00:05:03.532
Dr. King and Rosa Parks and E.D. Nixon